OL,3,GNEWSACarbon monoxide leak may cost
OL,4,Arestaurant its licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn East Sussex restaurant could lose
OL,7,Fits licence after a gas leak which saw
OL,8,F16 people from a nearby block of flats
OL,9,Ftreated for suspected carbon monoxide
OL,10,Fpoisoning.
OL,12,FHastings Borough Council (HBC) is set
OL,13,Fto consider a review application for
OL,14,Fthe Grand Pera restaurant in Harold
OL,15,FPlace, Hastings, on 9 September as
OL,16,Fofficers claim they have "no
OL,17,Fconfidence" in the owner's ability to
OL,18,Fmanage the premises.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
