OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACarbon monoxide leak may cost
OL,4,Arestaurant its licence
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental health officer Sharon
OL,7,FWhite said the leak in December was
OL,8,Fidentified as coming from "a petrol
OL,9,Fgenerator located in a corridor" of the
OL,10,Frestaurant and "had the potential to
OL,11,Fresult in fatalities".
OL,13,FThe restaurant has been contacted for
OL,14,Fcomment.
